        "text": "George A. Cardenas, a Democrat, is the Cook County Board of Review commissioner for the 1st District, elected in 2022. He previously served 20 years as a Chicago alderman, chairing the Environmental Protection and Energy Committee. In 2022, he pledged to assess properties at fair market value to reduce the burden on homeowners. He also supported releasing assessment methodology and reducing state tax appeal backlogs. His campaign says he launched a data dashboard and modernized internal technology. He told WTTW News he wants the board to remain independent and accountable to taxpayers. The Chicago Sun-Times reported that he said he helped homeowners in minority communities fight property tax increases.",
